        "text": "Reference class/base rate: the same official series from December 2025 through June 2026 is 569.11, 554.83, 545.67, 548.00, 544.44, 543.69, and 541.96 thousand. The level has drifted lower since the late-2025 high, but the last four prints are tightly clustered around 542 to 548 thousand rather than continuing the December-to-January drop."
